342
00:35:14,888 --> 00:35:15,922
Claire?

343
00:35:17,090 --> 00:35:18,390
Olhe para você.

344
00:35:19,926 --> 00:35:22,461
Toda sexta à noite, os homens

345
00:35:22,494 --> 00:35:24,965
