Olá?

435
00:42:17,953 --> 00:42:18,954
Ah!

436
00:42:35,937 --> 00:42:36,937
Ah!

437
00:43:46,943 --> 00:43:47,944
Pai?

438
00:43:52,482 --> 00:43:54,217
O que está acontecendo?

439
00:44:03,327 --> 00:44:04,495
Pai?

440
00:44:07,698 --> 00:44:08,999
O que...

441
